# Leave unset to run entirely on local fixtures (lib/mock).
# Set it and every page reads the live .NET API instead.
#
# There is deliberately no silent fallback from API to mocks: a demo that
# quietly serves stale fixtures while appearing live is worse than one that
# fails visibly.
#
# Local dev (API run with `dotnet run`):
# API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5169
#
# Docker Compose:
# API_BASE_URL=http://api:8080
